        "TileImage": "$($repository 22eca6ba-5392-4fdc-b941-d00ca02e4fce).Image",
        "Description": "Ritter is considering taking on a protégé. He has his eyes set on Robert Combs, an olympic gymnast and a former Cia agent, Carlton Smith. Interpol is planning on having Smith infiltrate Ritter&apos;s operation, to find information on Ritter&apos;s secret buyer. Therefore Ritter&apos;s first choice needs to be eliminated. Ritter&apos;s girlfriend Calista is attempting to convince him to quit his life of crime. This cannot happen before Smith can discover the buyers identity. You&apos;ll need to eliminate her as well.",
